# Raw screenshots and audit evidence are regenerated every round; the
# round-N.md reports that cite them are kept.
*/studio/qa/round-*/
*/studio/qa/builder-check/

# Site build output (create-next-app also writes its own .gitignore)
*/site/node_modules/
*/site/.next/
*/site/next-env.d.ts

# Reference screenshots are third-party site captures: working material only.
# research/references.md carries the URLs and the techniques worth borrowing.
*/studio/research/*.png
*/studio/research/**/*.png
